    {
      "text": "Finely chop the cucumber, tomatoes, parsley, mint and onion and put them in a bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "Squeeze the lemon juice over it and add the olive oil."
    },
    {
      "text": "Let the bulgur cool and add it to the bowl.",
